stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Recording : Start Recording

    Recording --> Stopped : Stop Recording
    Recording --> Cancelled : Cancel

    Stopped --> Normalizing : Parse Recording

    Normalizing --> Extracting : Generate actions.json

    Extracting --> ParameterReview : workflow_schema.json created

    ParameterReview --> Generating : Parameters Approved
    ParameterReview --> Extracting : User Edits Parameters

    Generating --> Validating : Playwright Script Generated

    Validating --> Packaging : Validation Passed
    Validating --> Failed : Validation Failed

    Packaging --> Installed : MCP Package Created
    Packaging --> Failed : Packaging Error

    Failed --> Extracting : Retry Extraction
    Failed --> Generating : Retry Generation
    Failed --> Validating : Retry Validation
    Failed --> Packaging : Retry Packaging

    Installed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]